# DirectorX — Quality First (No Compromise)

**Hardware:** RTX 5070 12GB local only. Time is unlimited. Speed is never a reason to lower quality.

## Non-negotiables

- Prefer the **highest practical quality** this box can deliver over faster/weaker presets.
- Do **not** default to proof shortcuts: Wan steps &lt; 14, skip two-pass MoE, freeze-pad, sine-only finals, silent “good enough” exports.
- Long renders → **external terminal** (never Cursor-tied).
- Prefer `scripts/wan_two_pass_moe.py` for Wan on 12GB; do not leave main pipeline on single-process dual-UNET if two-pass exists.
- Before claiming “cinematic / high quality / done”, verify with evidence (frames, ffprobe, run log).

## Max-quality defaults (when building/rendering)

- Flux: ≥22–25 steps; strong hero still before Wan.
- Wan: two-pass, **steps ≥14**, CFG ~4.0–4.5, native 480p OK → **1080 export** with grade (prefer sleep317-class upscale over bare lanczos).
- Identity: hero-plate lock minimum; push toward IP-Adapter / character LoRA when weights exist — prompt-only is not “locked”.
- Audio: real bed / TTS / Foley — no placeholder sine as final.
- No cloud APIs unless user explicitly asks.

## Forbidden rationalizations

- “Faster for demo” / “proof is enough” / “Q4 is fine so drop steps”
- Shipping soft 480p without 1080 master when export path exists
- Skipping face/identity work when the brief needs consistent characters
